15. [DONE RUNTIME] Camp grunts use an unscaled actor parent, direct projectile hits guarantee victim notice, gun noise remains nearby awareness, noncombat patrol is verified, and the startup debug grunt is disabled.

16. [DONE CONTRACT] Ordinary gameplay walls and void fascia have separate source roles. Fascia paints explicit chasm presentation only and owns neither collision nor navigation.

17. [DONE DEBUG] Debug builds show the Ritualant surface ingress as a distinctive minimap ring/cross marker; release builds do not.
